The Data Comprehension Problem
Nobody Understands What The Data Actually Means

The Challenge: Our data is filled with cryptic abbreviations and technical codes that are meaningless to most people—and even confusing across different systems.
DATABASE: MaintDB_East | TABLE: ENGINE_DEFECTS
ENGINE_SN: E-2847-XK
JCN: 2024-M-00847 What is JCN?
WCE: 74B What does this mean?
DEFECT_NO: DF-847
PART_NO: PT-9924-A
Business Impact

    Data analysts spend hours decoding field meanings
    New employees can't understand existing reports
    Executives can't make quick data-driven decisions
    AI/ML systems can't interpret data correctly
    Integration between systems becomes nearly impossible


